{#
  The parental authorization screen (specifications.md §44.5), laid out as
  the « Documents officiels — maquette » canvas fixes it: signatory, capacity,
  the activity picker, the two dates, the place, the abroad note, the warning,
  then the one action.

  The form posts to its own URL and comes back a PDF. Everything the parent
  types stays in the body — nothing about this document belongs in a query
  string a proxy log would keep.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Autorisation parentale — {{ site_name }}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="page-narrow">
    {% include 'partials/page_header.html.twig' with {
        title: 'Autorisation parentale',
        subtitle: member|display_name,
    } only %}

    <p>
        Le formulaire officiel de la fédération, pré-rempli avec ce que le site sait.
        À imprimer, signer, et remettre à l'animateur.
    </p>

    {% if submit_error %}
    <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">{{ submit_error }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    <form method="post" action="/members/{{ member.memberYearId }}/autorisation-parentale">
        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}

        <div class="card mb-3">
            <div class="card-body">
                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                    field_id: 'signatory-name', field_name: 'signatory_name',
                    label: 'Je soussigné·e', value: values.signatory_name, required: true,
                    autocomplete: 'name',
                    help: 'Le nom de la personne qui signera le document.',
                } only %}

                <fieldset class="mb-3">
                    <legend class="form-label">En qualité de</legend>
                    <div class="row g-2">
                        {% for capacity in capacities %}
                        <div class="col-6">
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="capacity"
                                       id="capacity-{{ capacity.value }}" value="{{ capacity.value }}"
                                       {{ values.capacity == capacity.value ? 'checked' : '' }} required>
                                <label class="form-check-label tap-target" for="capacity-{{ capacity.value }}">
                                    {{ capacity.label }}
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                {#
                  The picker only fills the two date fields below, in the
                  browser. The server is never sent an event identifier —
                  it is a convenience, not a source of truth, so there is
                  nothing to re-resolve and nothing to trust.

                  Absent entirely when the calendar module is disabled: the
                  two date fields stay and the form works unchanged.
                #}
                {% if events is not empty %}
                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                    field_id: 'event-picker', type: 'select',
                    label: 'Reprendre les dates d\'une activité',
                    help: 'Seules les activités qui couvrent au moins une nuit sont proposées.',
                    options: [{ value: '', label: 'Choisir une activité…' }]|merge(
                        events|map(event => {
                            value: event.start ~ '|' ~ event.end,
                            label: event.label,
                        })
                    ),
                    data: { 'event-picker': '1' },
                } only %}
                {% endif %}

                <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'start-date', field_name: 'start_date', type: 'date',
                            label: 'Du', value: values.start_date, required: true,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'end-date', field_name: 'end_date', type: 'date',
                            label: 'Au', value: values.end_date, required: true,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>

                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                    field_id: 'place', field_name: 'place',
                    label: 'Fait à', value: values.place, required: true,
                    help: 'Le lieu où vous signez le document.',
                } only %}

                <div class="form-check">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="abroad" id="abroad" value="1"
                           {{ values.abroad ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <label class="form-check-label tap-target" for="abroad">
                        Cette activité se déroule à l'étranger
                    </label>
                    <div class="form-text">
                        Sinon, la phrase autorisant la sortie du territoire belge est biffée, comme la note (1)
                        du formulaire le demande.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
            Le document n'a aucune valeur tant qu'il n'est pas signé à la main. Rien n'est enregistré sur le site.
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-100 w-sm-auto">
            <i class="bi bi-download me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Télécharger le PDF
        </button>
    </form>
</div>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/official-documents-event-picker.js') }}" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
